OL,3,GNEWSA'Dangerously long cancer waits
OL,4,Ahave me constantly on a knife-edge'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who has been fighting incurable
OL,7,Fcancer for seven years has said
OL,8,Fincreased times between scans and
OL,9,Fresults are becoming "dangerously long"
OL,10,Ffor himself and other patients.
OL,12,FJohn McClean said waiting for medical
OL,13,Foutcomes meant he was "constantly on a
OL,14,Fknife-edge". A lack of radiologists in
OL,15,FNorthern Ireland meant scans had to be
OL,16,Fsent to Australia to be analysed,
OL,17,Fleading to further delay, he said.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
