OL,3,GNEWSA'Dangerously long cancer waits
OL,4,Ahave me constantly on a knife-edge'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners, survivors and experts have
OL,7,Fgathered at Stormont to call on the
OL,8,Fexecutive to make a commitment to
OL,9,Freduce the cancer death rate by 15% by
OL,10,F2040.
OL,12,FThe Department of Health (DoH) said
OL,13,Fwhile cancer waiting times are "not
OL,14,Fwhere we want them to be", work is
OL,15,F"underway to improve performance".
